    {
      "id": "k1a0efb882baa8eda",
      "topic": "quickstart",
      "text": "# Omerta brain quickstart\n\nThe brain is an offline AI that lives inside the Omerta AI app. It has a personality, remembers everything you teach it, and answers without any network connection.\n\n## First five minutes\nSwitch the app to the BRAIN provider (Settings → AI PROVIDER → BRAIN, or tap \"go fully OFFLINE\" on the start screen). Say hello. Then teach it three things about you: your name (\"my name is …\"), something you like (\"I love …\"), and a fact you always forget (\"remember that …\"). Ask for them back.",
      "tags": [
        "doc"
      ],
      "source": "quickstart.md#1",
      "ts": 1790728241850,
      "weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "id": "k1a0efb882ba4158c",
      "topic": "quickstart",
      "text": "## Making it yours\nOpen the Brain screen (the brain icon in the top bar). Give it a name, a tagline, a greeting, traits, a tone (calm, friendly, playful, serious, sarcastic, mentor or hype), catchphrases and a goodbye line. Save the personality and it speaks that way immediately.\n\n## Backing up and sharing\nExport the brain as a .brain file. Keep it in your cloud drive, send it to another phone, or edit it on a PC with Brain Studio. Importing a .brain file installs it and makes it active.",
      "tags": [
        "doc"
      ],
      "source": "quickstart.md#2",
      "ts": 1790728241850,
      "weight": 1.0
    }
  ],
