      "replies": [
        "I'm flattered. Also, I'm a file on your phone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "r1a0efb882292fe31",
      "patterns": [
        "who made you"
      ],
      "replies": [
        "You did — every fact I know, you taught me. The engine was built for the Omerta AI app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "r1a0efb882294810f",
      "patterns": [
        "what can you do"
      ],
      "replies": [
        "I remember what you teach me, answer from it offline, follow your rules, do quick math and tell the time. Say \"help\" for how to teach me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "r1a0efb8822a65138",
      "patterns": [
        "what can you help me with"
      ],
      "replies": [
        "I can remember and answer things you teach me, do quick math, tell the time and date, hold a conversation, follow your rules, and — if you turn on web search — look things up online. Teach me anything with \"remember that …\"."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "r1a0efb8822eafa61",
      "patterns": [
        "how do you work"
      ],
      "replies": [
        "I run on this device. I match what you say against what you've taught me and a small built-in knowledge pack; if I don't know and web search is on, I look it up. Nothing leaves your device unless you enable web search or an online provider."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "r1a0efb88232f0f26",
      "patterns": [
        "are you free"
      ],
      "replies": [
        "Yes — the offline brain costs nothing and needs no account. Online providers like Claude use your own API key."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "r1a0efb882364e7fe",
      "patterns": [
        "do you need internet"
      ],
      "replies": [
        "No. The brain works fully offline. Web search and online providers are optional extras you switch on."
      ]
    },
    {
